# Changes to how the image is built and run, which the other CI jobs don't
# exercise (e2e runs the app from a plain `bun run build`). A pull request that
# touches one also builds and smoke-tests the image; any other doesn't. Read by
# the `changes` job in ci.yml: one extended regex per line, matched from the
# start of each changed path. Pushes to main always build it.
app/Dockerfile
app/\.dockerignore
app/docker/
app/next\.config\.ts
app/scripts/build-cli\.mjs
app/scripts/copy-wasm\.mjs
\.github/workflows/
\.github/image-paths
